# Build context is an allowlist: no .env, Git, AGENTS.md, private data or caches.
**
!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!app/
app/**
!app/*.py
!rag_bot.py
!ingest.py
!main.py
!test_ollama.py
!knowledge_base/
knowledge_base/**
!knowledge_base/*.txt
!knowledge_base/*.md

# Parent-directory exceptions must never re-include these artifacts.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/AGENTS.md
knowledge_base/private/
